  "details": "Description\n\nBlocking another player/friend who has osc info using the chatbox is still seen when the user is blocked. Not very useful if the offending user can still see you via the chat box.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nBlock a user or a friend and you will still see the chat box info above their head. There is no workaround currently unless you hide the chatbox on your end.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
